<title>USA: Ezcony names chief financial officer.</title>
<headline>Ezcony names chief financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ezcony Interamerica Inc on Wednesday said it named Ana Menendez chief financial officer. Menendez was previously chief financial officer of DIACO Inc, Ezcony, a distributor of consumer electronics in Latin America, said in a statement.</p>
<p>The name of her predecessor, if there was one, was not immediately available.</p>
